// SimulationRunResult is a run together with the summary it produced.
//
// Every field is what the engine measured during that run:
//   - plan:        the derived workload chain (users → DAU → requests/day →
//     average RPS → peak RPS).
//   - metrics:     throughput, latency (avg/p50/p95/p99/max), error and
//     timeout rates, and the per-component report.
//   - failures:    the per-request failure log.
//   - summary:     engine counters and the stop reason.
//   - diagnosis:   flagged bottlenecks with their computed reasons.
//   - capacity:    per-component modeled ceilings, utilization, headroom.
//   - cost:        the monthly estimate and its assumption trail.
